flowchart TB
  DCFG[Distributed Configuration]
  DCFG --> CS[Config Server]
  CS --> BACKEND[Backends]
  BACKEND --> NATIVE[Native / Filesystem]
  BACKEND --> GIT[Git Backend]
  BACKEND --> VAULT[HashiCorp Vault]
  CS --> ENCRYPT[Encryption]
  ENCRYPT --> SYM[Symmetric]
  ENCRYPT --> ASYM[Asymmetric]

  DCFG --> CLIENT[Config Client]
  CLIENT --> BS[bootstrap.yml]
  CLIENT --> FF[Fail-Fast]
  CLIENT --> RETRY[Retry Configuration]

  DCFG --> REFRESH[Runtime Refresh]
  REFRESH --> RFS[RefreshScope]
  REFRESH --> BUS[Spring Cloud Bus]
  BUS --> RMQ[RabbitMQ Binding]
  BUS --> KFK[Kafka Binding]
  REFRESH --> MON[Spring Cloud Config Monitor]
  MON --> WH[Webhook Triggers]

  DCFG --> VAULT2[HashiCorp Vault]
  VAULT2 --> SECRETS[Secrets Engine]
  VAULT2 --> TOKEN[Token Auth]
  VAULT2 --> K8S[Kubernetes Auth]
